    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "Paper2Agent uses a **Model Context Protocol (MCP) server** to represent the paper's methods and tools. The MCP server is created by **extracting information from the paper and its codebase**, and then **validating the tools** through automated testing. The resulting MCP server is then connected to an AI agent, enabling **natural language interaction** with the paper's methods.",
