    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "Paper2Agent has been applied to several research papers, including AlphaGenome, TISSUE, and Scanpy. The resulting AI agents have been shown to be **highly accurate** and **efficient**, and have enabled **new discoveries** to be made by applying the paper's methods to new data. For example, the AlphaGenome agent was able to **identify a new splicing variant associated with ADHD risk**.",
